The generated tables in src/data/ are derived from the following works:

1. Joint Military Symbology XML (JMSML), Esri, https://github.com/Esri/joint-military-symbology-xml
   (commit 094e7647f0bdd001e42fd2a73ba802c995af20aa). Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
   Used: instance/*.xml (2525D catalog, legacy 2525C links, field code tables).

2. mil-sym-ts, US Army Combat Capabilities Development Command C5ISR Center,
   https://github.com/missioncommand/mil-sym-ts (commit 9f3c5512ecc8b9458da32328991b899910dafe7b).
   Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
   Used: c2d.json, msd.json, mse.json, smd.json, sme.json.

3. MIL-STD-2525C, Common Warfighting Symbology, 17 November 2008. US Department of Defense,
   Distribution A: approved for public release, distribution is unlimited.
   Used: SIDC catalog rows (Tables A-III, B-III, C-II, D-II, E-III, G-III).

The derived tables were transformed (re-keyed and reduced) by scripts/build-data.mjs.
